  "body": "SET DATE OF SALE CLOSES 4pm, THURSDAY 12th NOVEMBER 2026 (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned on the water's edge, this exceptional residence delivers a lifestyle that few properties can match. With direct access to the stunning Te Ara Tahuna Walkway and Cycleway, the home enjoys breathtaking panoramic views across the Orewa Estuary, where ever-changing tides, shimmering sunlight and abundant birdlife create a spectacular natural backdrop. \r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, you'll appreciate the timeless elegance and quality craftsmanship showcased throughout. The expansive open-plan living with rich American Oak flooring and a beautifully appointed coastal-inspired kitchen combine to create an outstanding entertaining and family environment. Featuring marble benchtops, premium appliances and a generous butler's pantry, the kitchen is as functional as it is impressive. \r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless indoor-outdoor living, large over size glass stacker sliding doors open to a north-facing covered entertaining area complete with a fully equipped outdoor kitchen. Overlooking meticulously landscaped gardens, tranquil water features and your own private golf putting and chipping green, this is a setting that invites relaxation and year-round entertaining. \r\n\r\nThe home offers four generously sized bedrooms, expansive open-plan living and dining spaces, a dedicated media room, plus a large separate wine cellar. The luxurious master suite is privately positioned away from the remaining bedrooms, creating a peaceful retreat enhanced by stunning estuary views. \r\n\r\nPremium features abound, including a grand gas fireplace, underfloor heating in the bathrooms, an automated louvre system, high end fittings and a surround sound system throughout both indoor and outdoor living areas. \r\n\r\nPracticality is equally well catered for, with abundant storage throughout, double internal-access garaging and a substantial gym area on the lower level. \r\n\r\nStep beyond your garden and enjoy a lifestyle centred around the water. Whether it's walking, cycling, jogging, kayaking, fishing or simply taking in the beauty of your surroundings, this remarkable location offers endless opportunities for recreation and relaxation. \r\n\r\nRarely do waterfront properties of this calibre become available. Combining luxury, privacy, outstanding amenities and an unrivalled waterfront position, this is a truly exceptional opportunity to secure one of Red Beach’s finest lifestyle residences.",
